Fix (Playwright): install and pause the clock before navigating, then move time forward yourself.
  await page.clock.install({ time: new Date('2026-01-01T00:00:00') });
  await page.clock.pauseAt(new Date('2026-01-01T00:00:00'));
  await page.goto(url);
  await page.clock.runFor(1000); // or fastForward()

Tips:
- Set up the clock in a shared fixture or beforeEach so no test can call goto first.
- Iframes and workers may not pick up the fake clock. Check them if tests are still flaky.
- Don't use waitForTimeout (it uses real time). Advance the paused clock instead.
